            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "crs1716"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a quick and easy dip recipe if you are short on time. The last time I made it, I used wasabi cocktail sauce, and the kick really blended well with the cream cheese. Sometimes I use neufchatel cheese, for a lower fat option.",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-27T12:44:11.380Z"
          },
          {
